            portrait: "portraits/kapoue.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("We had better go look."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_24",
        on: "branch_if_24",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "second_unit.id",
            not_equals: "Kapou'e",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            portrait: "portraits/kapoue.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("You had better go look."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Yes, Chief."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_25",
        on: "branch_if_25",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "second_unit.id",
            equals: "Kapou'e",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            portrait: "portraits/kapoue-angry.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("The human-worms and tree-shaggers have gone too far! BLOOD AND STEEL! I want every human and elf in this area slaughtered! Show no mercy, give no quarter!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_26",
        on: "branch_if_26",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "second_unit.id",
            not_equals: "Kapou'e",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Chief! It’s true, the shamans have been murdered!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            portrait: "portraits/kapoue-angry.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("<i>What</i>?! The human-worms and tree-shaggers have gone too far! BLOOD AND STEEL! I want every human and elf in this area slaughtered! Show no mercy, give no quarter!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("What should I do with this one?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            portrait: "portraits/kapoue-angry.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("Throw him in the lake. If he freezes to death, all the better."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_22",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Thelarion%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Miserable elf, we want some answers!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thelarion",
            text: _("Ugh!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("SPEAK!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thelarion",
            text: _("... Well, what do you want to know?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("You can start by telling us who told you to strike at Borstep."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thelarion",
            text: _("Uh... we have intelligence."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Don’t make me hurt you more."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thelarion",
            text: _("I yield. Shan Taum the Smug told us that that’s where the shamans were, and that it was a rally point and weapons depot for you orcs."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Bah, do not think you can break the unity of the horde with your stupid lies!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thelarion",
            text: _("No really, it’s true. He is jealous of some young upstart called Kapou’e. He says all the shamans ‘suck up’ to him just because his father had a black eye or something like that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Refer to Black-Eye Karun with respect, wose-born. Now, where are the shamans?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thelarion",
            text: _("They’re... the humans killed them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("You lie!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thelarion",
            text: _("I do not. Their bodies are frozen in the lake just over there."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_23",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_24",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("A few minutes later..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_25",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_26",
          },
        ],
